# Proto comments

Comment every `rpc` and field. Russian, spoken language. No trailing period.

Do not comment a message just to say «запрос» / «ответ». Keep a message comment only for a pitfall.

Do not strip neighboring comments to “clean up” a file. The C# “do not restate the member” rule does not apply here.

```protobuf
// Создаёт страницу
rpc CreatePage (CreatePageRequest) returns (CreatePageResponse);

message CreatePageRequest {
  // Страница
  Page page = 1;
}
```
